{'symbol': 'EQT', 'date': '2022-06-22 06:30:00', 'title': 'EQT RELEASES 2021 ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE REPORT', 'text': 'COMPANY MAKES SUBSTANTIAL PROGRESS ON ALL EMISSION REDUCTION GOALS WHILE CHAMPIONING CRITICAL ROLE OF NATURAL GAS PITTSBURGH\xa0, JUNE 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQT CORPORATION (NYSE: EQT), THE LARGEST PRODUCER OF NATURAL GAS IN THE UNITED STATES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PUBLICATION OF ITS 2021 ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) REPORT, HIGHLIGHTING THE COMPANY\'S SIGNIFICANT PROGRESS IN ACHIEVING NET ZERO SCOPE 1 AND 2 GHG EMISSIONS, AS WELL AS ITS LEADERSHIP IN ADVOCATING FOR NATURAL GAS AS AN AFFORDABLE, RELIABLE AND CLEAN ENERGY SOURCE FOR THE U.S. AND THE WORLD. "IN ADDITION TO OUR OWN POSITIVE ESG PERFORMANCE AND SIGNIFICANT EMISSIONS REDUCTIONS, EQT INSERTED ITSELF INTO THE GLOBAL CONVERSATION ABOUT THE CRITICAL ROLE NATURAL GAS PLAYS IN ARRESTING CLIMATE CHANGE AND PROVIDING ENERGY SECURITY AND INDEPENDENCE TO OUR ALLIES.'}